      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR SHIRAZ (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.70) at this track behind Rapidfire Layla in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FREQUENCY (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at Traralgon, but was among the placings at Traralgon three back. Well placed here and can atone this time. BELGIUM SLICE (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (23.01) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including six wins. Great chance to atone. SHY CABANG (8) is a last-start placegetter after finding the front early - solid claims again.",
